      "content": "i mean, i know people want to 'help' but they're just helping me pretend. they want me to fit back into a box that doesn't make sense anymore. it's exhausting. sometimes i think the only way to actually be honest with myself is to just... stop trying to participate in this fake life. to just exit the theater.",
